# AR Hydraulics and Sealing Solutions — environment configuration
#
# The quote and contact forms currently submit via a mailto: fallback and do
# not require any of the variables below. They are documented here as the
# next step once a server-side form handler is wired up (e.g. an API route
# using Resend/SMTP, or a hosted form service).
#
# Never commit real values for these variables — this file only documents
# the keys that will eventually be required.

# SMTP / transactional email (for a future form-submission API route)
# SMTP_HOST=
# SMTP_PORT=
# SMTP_USER=
# SMTP_PASSWORD=
# CONTACT_FORM_RECIPIENT=arhydraulicssolutions@gmail.com

# Optional: Google Maps JavaScript API key (only needed if the embedded map
# is upgraded from the current no-key iframe embed to the JS Maps SDK)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

# Optional: spam protection for public forms (e.g. hCaptcha / reCAPTCHA)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=
# CAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY=
